        <mxCell id="legend-text" value="1. UI + data API served from ONE origin/stage (/api)&#xa;2. No CloudFront, no ALB — execute-api VPCE fronts both&#xa;3. Cognito reached over internet egress (VPN/NAT) — no VPCE&#xa;4. WebUIClientOAuthUrls custom resource registers the&#xa;    execute-api /api/ URL on the Cognito client post-deploy&#xa;5. WAFv2 IP allow-list (optional) protects the whole stage" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="970" y="556" width="360" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
